	<remark>Modification kit for "Victory". Split sets require victorba.zip and victory.zip. Game video, pause, CRT controls and automatic NVRAM saving. Dimming starts after 10 seconds paused. First boot without a save: press a button at CMOS RAM RESET.</remark>
